{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1214989-mortal-bodies-and-fae-meins-in-the-mundane-and-the-dreaming","id":1214989,"title":"Mortal Bodies and Fae Meins in the mundane and the Dreaming","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-04T04:30:14-07:00","id":1214989,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Mortal Bodies and Fae Meins in the mundane and the Dreaming","content":"Few things that Changeling has always seem to have been vague on. <br /> <br /> 1) Does your mortal body reflect all your dreaming actions. If I punch a troll in the face am I pretending fighting in the real world? OR if I use wayfair to jump high in the dream how does my body reflect that? <br /> 2) What happens to a mortal body when your fae self travels to the far dreaming? <br /> <br /> Thank you,<br /> <br /> James","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5059-johnsonhavoc","name":"johnsonhavoc","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-04T05:09:22-07:00","id":1214998,"title":"","content":"Hello,<br /> <br /> 1) The Mortal &amp; Fae Mien does the same. It's easy with the troll, who have a human body, but more interesting with a Chimera. It would seem as a street performer fighting an invisible foe. If a disrepancy occurs (a dragon tailslap you and you fly 30 meters), the Mist roll help to cloud the memories.<br /> 3) Goes into the dreaming, following the trod.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><im